    "description": {
      "value": "This bone statuette of a sneering gremlin crumbles to dust when activated, imparting a fraction of its subject's infamous misfortune on those you strike. The damaged creature must attempt a DC 33 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature must roll twice and take the worse result on the next check it attempts.\n- **Failure:** The creature must roll twice and take the worse result on all checks until the end of its next turn.\n\nActivate (Free Action); Components envision; Trigger You damage a flat-footed creature with the affixed weapon."
